# aio-gate + AIOStreams bundled container — copy to .env and adjust.
# (docker compose --env-file .env up -d --build)

# ── AIOStreams ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Public URL of this instance — AIOStreams uses it for playback links,
# and the gate uses it to build shareable key URLs and rewrites.
BASE_URL=https://stream.dill.moe
DATABASE_URI=sqlite://./data/db.sqlite
NODE_ENV=production
AIOSTREAMS_AUTH=admin:change-me
SECRET_KEY=change-me-32-characters-random

# ── aio-gate ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Master manifest URL (optional — can also be set in the panel: Settings).
# If set, it acts as the default; the panel value overrides it.
# Find uuid/password in the AIOStreams panel: Save & Install -> Copy URL,
# then replace the host with http://127.0.0.1:3210
MASTER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3210/stremio/your-uuid/your-password/manifest.json
# Gate admin login — falls back to the first AIOSTREAMS_AUTH pair.
# ADMIN_USERNAME=admin
# ADMIN_PASSWORD=change-me
# SESSION_SECRET=change-me-too
# PORT=3000
# AIOSTREAMS_INTERNAL_PORT=3210
# Proxy trust is ON by default: X-Forwarded-For / X-Real-IP give the real
# client IP (key info, sessions, history, login rate-limiting) and
# X-Forwarded-Proto/Host fix the base URL behind a reverse proxy.
# Set TRUST_PROXY=0 only when the gate is directly exposed with no proxy
# in front, or clients can spoof those headers.
# TRUST_PROXY=1
# KEY_LENGTH=12
# Watch history is kept for this many days, then deleted automatically (1-365).
# HISTORY_RETENTION_DAYS=30
# Max watch-history entries kept per key (newest win).
# HISTORY_MAX_PER_KEY=2000
# Min gap between title-lookup retries for a titleless history entry (ms).
# HISTORY_META_RETRY_MS=30000
# When the master can't name an item, look it up on IMDb's suggestion API
# for tt* ids (no key needed). Set to 0 to disable.
# TITLE_IMDB_FALLBACK=1
# Override the IMDb suggestion API base (tests / self-hosted mirrors).
# IMDB_SUGGEST_URL=https://v2.sg.media-imdb.com
